==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Team Up|Flaaffy|42}} from the {{TCG|Team Up}} expansion; both cards have the Electric Punch attack.
*'''Electric Punch''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Neo Revelation|Flaaffy|28}} from the {{TCG|Neo Revelation}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

